g&oe=69A6D54F"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_jH60ls4FrN.png", "id": "568857852463480", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_568857855796813_5401280815376791430_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=trCvISHO6CcQ7kNvwH4VkQr&_nc_oc=AdlszGI1Cxh2YfwRjxQKcBZKDsiqc7bAjRjUcesiiOafrAtHgO26zkgnpOX7Lvm6vlQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsFOH-lrpp9QT256TIZdkG6y3nX8aYJiZCGCDYwUeiVxA&oe=69A6E903"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The use of descending life line_Landscape.png", "id": "924296409342275", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86629761_924296412675608_6973496143769541780_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VGStmgLoIMwQ7kNvwFU1AQf&_nc_oc=AdmRGR2Z7-AdJNywoFX6L7FU-5YtSr4zwTggBeZuXtTq61e08Qvzj7XxX3CElscYCvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftI_olLCMVP9Use6xYYecqOIc3qfkEoS9pqXM1B5jo-HQ&oe=69A6D378"}, "display_name": "The Use Of Descending Life Line- ContentsDa", "keywords": ["safety", "fire", "descent", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Fire situation: There is a fire and you need to escape.\n2. Use the sturdy: Utilize the sturdy to escape.\n3. Install the Stubborn: Install the green hook from the Stubborn box onto the Stubborn support.\n4. Set the speeder: Set the red speeder by overlapping it on the hook.\n5. Move the Stubborn Support: Grab the Stubborn Support and move it off the railing.\n6. Throw the rope: Throw the rope wound on the black reel out the window.\n7. Manipulate the stubbornness belt: Lower the yellow stubbornness belt under your armpits and tighten it.\n8. safe descent: Hold onto the wall with your hands and descend safely without lifting your arms.\n9. successful escape: You have safely escaped and overcome the fire situation.", "short_description": "Understand the critical use of life lines in rescue operations. This experiment teaches the proper techniques for descending f